# The catalogs the apps bundle that aren't in git. Each is a gzipped asset (its file name plus .gz) on
# the GitHub release below, so Xcode Cloud and GitHub Actions can fetch them:
#   Scripts/publish-catalogs.sh   uploads the local catalogs as a new release and rewrites this file
#   Scripts/fetch-catalogs.sh     downloads and checks them (Xcode Cloud runs it from ci_post_clone.sh)
# Lines: path from the repo root, then the SHA-256 of the uncompressed file.
